# Phases 51, 52 & 53: Pure Reality Transition

This plan outlines the total transition from a "local tool" to an independent, production-grade platform.

## Phase 52 & 53: Legacy Purge & Quantum Stability

Ensure the autonomous infrastructure is pass-through stable and 100% "Pure Reality" compliant.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This phase removes the final Rust-level tracers of Solana from the `quantum_bridge` and fixes the CI bottlenecks for the autonomous loop.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component] Swarm Quantum Bridge (Rust)
Final purification of the Rust-based oracle.

#### [MODIFY] [truth.rs](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/quantum_bridge/src/kernel/truth.rs)
- Convert [verify_cross_consistency](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/quantum_bridge/src/kernel/truth.rs#57-70) to a static method (remove `&self`).
- Fix `Axiom` comparisons using `Eq` and robust logic.
- Add `#[allow(dead_code)]` for constants intended for future expansion to satisfy strict CI lints.

#### [MODIFY] [lattice.rs](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/quantum_bridge/src/kernel/lattice.rs)
- Update calls to [verify_cross_consistency](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/quantum_bridge/src/kernel/truth.rs#57-70) to match the static signature (call via `TruthAnchor::`).

#### [MODIFY] [tx_audit.rs](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/quantum_bridge/src/oracle/tx_audit.rs)
- Purge Solana transaction parsing logic.
- Implement a generic "Sovereign Audit" that validates internal coordinating signals.

#### [MODIFY] [program_whitelist.rs](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/quantum_bridge/src/oracle/program_whitelist.rs)
- Purge Solana program IDs.
- Transition to "Verified Sovereign Modules" list.

### [Component] Infrastructure
Fixing Git bottlenecks.

#### [MODIFY] [.gitignore](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.gitignore)
- Explicitly unignore `src/data/quantum_*.json` to allow evolution results to be tracked.

#### [MODIFY] [quantum_evolution.yml](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.github/workflows/quantum_evolution.yml)
- Update `git add` to target specific results and handle ignored states gracefully.

